@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Identity across live property events and restart (proposed acceptance)

[*] --> RunA : run starts\n(runId A, settings rev N)
RunA --> RunA : valid live property event\nall values applied as one event;\nsettings rev N -> N+1;\nsource/program hashes and runId unchanged
RunA --> RunA : invalid multi-property event\nwhole event rejected;\nno property mutates
RunA --> RunB : real restart\n(GhostFlow restart event)
RunB : new runId B
RunB : accepted settings persist
RunB : response = authored GhostFlow logic\n(no global resume/manual policy)
@enduml
